       04          
04218C DD CB 1D 76 0083*       bit sprite_alive,(ix+sprite_collisions)
042190 CA 9C 21 04 0084*       jp z,@F ; player is dead so don't check for collisions
042194 CD 16 20 04 0085*       call check_enemy_collision_player
042198 CA BC 21 04 0086*       jp z,@player
04219C             0087*   @@:
04219C CD 0A 20 04 0088*       call check_enemy_collision_laser
