048F66 CA 76 8F 04 0033*       jp z,@animate ; player is dead so don't check for collisions
048F6A CD 16 20 04 0034*       call check_enemy_collision_player
048F6E C2 76 8F 04 0035*       jp nz,@animate ; no collision so do animation
